(ACME WIDGETS -- REMOTE WORK POLICY) Tj
T*
(Version 3, effective January 2026.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This handbook explains how remote work operates at Acme Widgets. It) Tj
T*
(covers eligibility, working hours, equipment, vacation and time off,) Tj
T*
(expenses, and security. Keep this document handy; it is the source of) Tj
T*
(truth for anything related to working from home.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. ELIGIBILITY) Tj
T*
(All full-time employees who have completed their 90-day probation may) Tj
T*
(work remotely up to four days per week. Fully remote arrangements need) Tj
T*
(written approval from your manager and the head of your department.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
