(2. WORKING HOURS) Tj
T*
(Core collaboration hours are 10am to 3pm in your team's main time zone.) Tj
T*
(You may arrange the rest of your working day flexibly. If you work) Tj
T*
(across time zones, agree a shared overlap window with your manager.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. VACATION AND TIME OFF) Tj
T*
(Full-time employees receive 25 days of paid vacation per year, plus) Tj
T*
(public holidays. Vacation accrues monthly and unused days may be carried) Tj
T*
(over up to a maximum of 5 days into the next year. Request vacation at) Tj
T*
(least two weeks in advance through the HR portal. Sick leave is separate) Tj
T*
(and is capped at 10 paid days per year.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
