(4. EQUIPMENT AND EXPENSES) Tj
T*
(Acme provides a laptop and a monitor to every remote employee. You may) Tj
T*
(claim up to 500 dollars for a home-office desk and chair in your first) Tj
T*
(year. Internet costs are reimbursed at 30 dollars per month. Submit all) Tj
T*
(expense claims through the finance portal within 60 days.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. SECURITY) Tj
T*
(Always connect through the company VPN when handling customer data. Turn) Tj
T*
(on full-disk encryption and lock your screen when you step away. Report) Tj
T*
(any lost device to the security team within 24 hours.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
